  "description": "Andrew Deftereoes of Leonard Wilson Keenan is delighted to present 48 Elm Mount Road, to the market. This fabulous home has been loved and improved to a high standard by its proud current owners who have created a stylish and well-designed haven. Its excellent location and East facing garden add to its superiority. A stunning family home it is the perfect property to upgrade to for any discerning purchaser or for an investor.\n\nUpon arrival you are met with an impressive large drive. A new front door welcomes you into the property at the ground floor level into a well-proportioned, bright hallway leading off of which is a spacious and bright living room. Large windows flood the living areas with light while tall ceilings enhance the sense of space, creating a warm and welcoming space in which you can relax, unwind, and escape to after a long day. Further on off the hallway is a lovely upgraded kitchen /dining room which benefits from direct access to the large East facing private rear garden through glass sliding doors. The designer garden has been transformed into a fabulous entertaining and relaxing area to take full advantage of the summers. There is also a good size block shed currently used as a gym with electrics which has endless possibilities for other uses.  \n\nThe lovely solid ash kitchen has an abundance of base and eye level storage and high-quality integrated appliances with good counter tops. A utility space completes the ground floor. Upstairs is a good sized en suite East facing main bedroom and there are two other West facing bedrooms on this floor and a family bathroom. The en suite is new and the family bathroom has been upgraded. Access to the floored attic with a stira stair completes this floor.  \n\n\nFeatures:-\n\n· New kitchen.\n\n·New floors.\n\n· Paved garden\n\n· New en suite and upgraded family bathroom\n\n· Triple glazed windows\n\n· New front door\n\n· Attic floored with stira stairs\n\n\nElm Mount is a mature and family-friendly estate located in the heart of Beaumont, one of Dublin 9s most established residential areas. The neighborhood is well known for its strong sense of community, leafy streets and convenient access to a wide variety of amenities. There is an excellent selection of both primary and secondary schools nearby including St Fiachras National School, Our Lady of Mercy College and Maryfield College, while Dublin City University is only a short distance away and easily reached on foot or by bicycle.\n\nResidents of Elm Mount have an abundance of shopping options close at hand, with Omni Park Shopping Centre offering supermarkets, cafes, retailers, a cinema and a food court. Artane Castle Shopping Centre, Northside Shopping Centre and Santry Retail Park are also within easy reach. Sporting and leisure facilities are also extremely well catered for, with Whitehall Colmcille GAA Club, Beaumont United FC and St Kevins Athletic FC all located locally.\n\nTransport links are superb Dublin City Centre is approximately 5 km away and can be reached in around fifteen minutes by car or bus. Several regular and reliable bus routes, including the 1, 14, 16, 33 and 41, serve the area, providing convenient access to the city and surrounding areas. Dublin Airport is also close by and can be reached in as little as ten minutes by car. In addition, the M1 and M50 motorway network is easily accessible, making commuting and travel further afield exceptionally convenient.\n\nFor outdoor activities and recreation, there are several parks nearby including Ellenfield Park and Santry Demesne, which both offer attractive green spaces for walking, running or spending time with family. Overall, Elm Mounts combination of convenience, excellent amenities and strong community spirit make it one of the most desirable addresses in Dublin 9.\n\n \n\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\n\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed 